          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The 95th percentile wait time for a thread to acquire a DuckDB connection from the pool. High wait times mean queries are queued waiting for connections, suggesting the connection pool might be exhausted or queries are too slow."
